      Corporation.
    </p>
    <p>
      Apple manages App Store purchases, billing, and refunds under Apple's terms.
      Availability and features can change as iOS, WidgetKit, Roblox services, or other
      dependencies change.
    </p>
  </LegalSection>

  <LegalSection heading="Acceptable use">
    <p>You must not:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
